{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>But the wheat and the emmer.</b> See how great was the wickedness of Pharaoh and his servants: even though the wheat and the emmer were not struck, and Moses prayed, and Pharaoh saw that all the harm had ceased through his prayer — for otherwise it would have consumed even the remaining survivors — nevertheless Pharaoh continued to sin and hardened his heart deliberately, he and his servants."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:59.719239175Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}